{"2889160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Zodchy", "steam_appid": 2889160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889160/extras/1aa0b6e7e6d1c6e5c095a6fe786f4f4e.avif?t=1761230115\" width=1184 height=247 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zodchy</strong> is a top-down, co-op PvE action game for 1-10 players, set on the volatile surfaces of alien worlds. Drop into short, intense missions, tackle bonus objectives for extra rewards, and extract with valuable loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teamwork is your greatest weapon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889160/extras/c36ebdfc4a7712bfedcfd84591e2cdff.webp?t=1761230115\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DEPLOY. ADAPT. SURVIVE. EXTRACT.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889160/extras/a4579a7b0ae0c7ce4ea62d9e00cc5944.poster.avif?t=1761230115\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889160/extras/a4579a7b0ae0c7ce4ea62d9e00cc5944.webm?t=1761230115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889160/extras/a4579a7b0ae0c7ce4ea62d9e00cc5944.mp4?t=1761230115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zodchy</strong> is a cooperative PvE action game where you and your squad undertake perilous missions across hostile alien worlds teeming with exotic flora and deadly fauna. Each session is a self-contained, action-packed scenario lasting 1-3 hours. Your objective: drop onto the planet, fulfill your contract, and make it back with the prize... if you can survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889160/extras/c36ebdfc4a7712bfedcfd84591e2cdff.webp?t=1761230115\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>INTENSE CO-OP SCENARIOS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889160/extras/76edde0c9054ffa3b321154b5263c911.poster.avif?t=1761230115\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889160/extras/76edde0c9054ffa3b321154b5263c911.webm?t=1761230115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889160/extras/76edde0c9054ffa3b321154b5263c911.mp4?t=1761230115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission presents a unique set of challenges. Defend outposts from hordes of predators, retrieve valuable artifacts from monster-infested caves, eliminate colossal bosses, or simply try to survive until dawn. Thanks to our &quot;Scenario Director&quot; system, no two missions are ever the same, ensuring every playthrough feels fresh and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889160/extras/c36ebdfc4a7712bfedcfd84591e2cdff.webp?t=1761230115\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A UNIVERSE OF DEADLY WORLDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889160/extras/ae0650202e586d80dc047a9cbc3de315.poster.avif?t=1761230115\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889160/extras/ae0650202e586d80dc047a9cbc3de315.webm?t=1761230115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889160/extras/ae0650202e586d80dc047a9cbc3de315.mp4?t=1761230115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each planet is a new theater of war with its own set of rules. Battle across silicon steppes and forests where the very ground can be your enemy. Survive in bioluminescent swamps, crystalline fields, and volcanic regions. As night falls, an anomalous moon rises, turning even the flora into lethal adversaries and empowering the local fauna to terrifying new strengths. Adapt or perish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889160/extras/c36ebdfc4a7712bfedcfd84591e2cdff.webp?t=1761230115\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>ADAPTIVE TECH AND GEAR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889160/extras/28e37a6ca2b7e4a8ee9204b2a0e490bf.poster.avif?t=1761230115\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889160/extras/28e37a6ca2b7e4a8ee9204b2a0e490bf.webm?t=1761230115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889160/extras/28e37a6ca2b7e4a8ee9204b2a0e490bf.mp4?t=1761230115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression in <strong>Zodchy</strong>  isn't about long-term base building, but about adapting your gear for the mission at hand. Use resources gathered in the heat of battle to craft and upgrade your weapons and armor. Unlock exotic technologies, complete objectives, trade with NPCs, and forge unique equipment that will help you survive the next encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889160/extras/c36ebdfc4a7712bfedcfd84591e2cdff.webp?t=1761230115\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>BUILT FOR COOPERATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889160/extras/5a23911bdb0871ee3df91561d4c066b4.poster.avif?t=1761230115\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889160/extras/5a23911bdb0871ee3df91561d4c066b4.webm?t=1761230115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889160/extras/5a23911bdb0871ee3df91561d4c066b4.mp4?t=1761230115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zodchy</strong>  is a PvE-focused game at its core. Friendly fire is disabled by default, and the global objectives from the &quot;Scenario Director&quot; are designed to encourage teamwork. Mission quests can be tackled by players sequentially or in parallel. PvP is strictly limited to designated zones and consensual duels, ensuring it never interferes with the core gameplay loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>New worlds await their explorers!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889160/extras/1aa0b6e7e6d1c6e5c095a6fe786f4f4e.avif?t=1761230115\" width=1184 height=247 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zodchy</strong> is a top-down, co-op PvE action game for 1-10 players, set on the volatile surfaces of alien worlds. Drop into short, intense missions, tackle bonus objectives for extra rewards, and extract with valuable loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teamwork is your greatest weapon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889160/extras/c36ebdfc4a7712bfedcfd84591e2cdff.webp?t=1761230115\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DEPLOY. ADAPT. SURVIVE. EXTRACT.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889160/extras/a4579a7b0ae0c7ce4ea62d9e00cc5944.poster.avif?t=1761230115\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889160/extras/a4579a7b0ae0c7ce4ea62d9e00cc5944.webm?t=1